19. **Undo UX: SIMPLE UNDO-LAST + HISTORY BEHIND DISCLOSURE.**
20. **Playtest: RESUMABLE, SOLO FIRST** — presentation polish deferred.
21. **TTS narration: POST-PLAYTEST BACKLOG CANDIDATE.**

